<title>AUSTRIA: BBAG merges two brewery units.</title>
<headline>BBAG merges two brewery units.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian beverage group BBAG Oesterreichische Brau-Beteiligungs AG said on Friday it would merge two of its breweries, Steirerbrau AG and Oesterreichische Brau AG.</p>
<p>The two units are 100-percent owned by Brau Union, which in turn is majority-controlled by BBAG.</p>
